                      (            os9.d):00031         *
                      (            os9.d):00032         *          1983/11/29
                      (            os9.d):00033         * Added SS.RsBit to reserve (not allocate in) bitmap sector.
                      (            os9.d):00034         *
                      (            os9.d):00035         *          1984/02/17
                      (            os9.d):00036         * Added reserved status codes for Hoshi and Gimix.
                      (            os9.d):00037         *
