                      (            os9.d):00040         * Added New signal code S$Window ... CoCo future.
                      (            os9.d):00041         *
                      (            os9.d):00042         *          1984/04/11  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00043         * Added SS.Sound for CoCo.
                      (            os9.d):00044         *
                      (            os9.d):00045         *          1984/05/05  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00046         * Added label SS.SetMF to Gimix Reserved byte
                      (            os9.d):00047         * Changed SS.Sound to SS.KySns.
                      (            os9.d):00048         *
                      (            os9.d):00049         *          1985/05/24  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00050         * Added SS.ComSt Communication Set (Parity,Baud).
                      (            os9.d):00051         *
                      (            os9.d):00052         *          1985/05/28  Tim A. Harris
