                      (            os9.d):00056         * Added SS.Open, SS.Close, SS.HngUP.
                      (            os9.d):00057         *
                      (            os9.d):00058         *          1985/07/30  Mark G. Hawkins
                      (            os9.d):00059         * Added E$HangUp error for CDC Lost.
                      (            os9.d):00060         *
                      (            os9.d):00061         *          1985/08/24  Doug J. Nicholson
                      (            os9.d):00062         * Added DT.NFM device type.
                      (            os9.d):00063         *
